msgstr "Protezione da Spam &amp; Abuso"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1697 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2524
msgid "Require two-factor authentication"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1698
msgid ""
"Members are always free to switch two-factor on themselves. This makes it "
